 6. 🤑 Pricey and packed 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data : BLS. (No data for Oct. 2025 due to lapse in appropriations.) Chart: Sara Wise/Axios Admission prices for movies, theaters and concerts in the U.S. have jumped more than 41% since January 2016, Axios' Kerry Flynn writes as part of an Axios Media Trends Executive briefing. 

 Fans are still showing up: The average ticket price for Billboard's top 100 global tours rose from $84.15 in 2015 to $127.17 last year, while attendance across those tours roughly doubled over the same period. ( Luminate ) Share this chart ... Subscribe to Axios Media Trends Executive . 

 
 
